        "id": 1293547
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-29T05:54:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Adding this to all the versions of `clock_enable_module` is dangerous.\nBecause the compiler would not warn you if you link two weak symbols at the same time.\nAnd the final result will depend on the file order we put in the linker stage.",
      "parentUuid": "37026100_f1c284ff",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "73aab4bb2eb443f4cdbc9b2088505b80289fbfc6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "732a66be_a09fd605",
        "filename": "chip/host/clock.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 16,
      "author": {
        "id": 1293547
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-29T05:57:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "And we already do the same thing to `test_mockable timestamp_t get_time(void)`. (Only mock the host version.)",
      "parentUuid": "346413bc_1f87f508",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "73aab4bb2eb443f4cdbc9b2088505b80289fbfc6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "afd1feb5_51b7df75",
